1. abc! 4 
2. the members beside it: 0  0  []
3. nested: in out 7  2 
4. a static array: [] one two
5. from element to element: one+ one
6. a read with an index outside: [ [error 9 ] oneone+
7. after ERASE: [] 0  2 
8. REDIM _PRESERVE: keep too 5  []
9. REDIM _PRESERVE to fewer elements: [] 0 
10. REDIM: [] 0 
11. ERASE of the dynamic array: [error 9 ]
12. a local, twice: [][]
13. a STATIC one, twice: k kk 
14. passed by reference: abc!?
15. a long string and an empty one: 1000  0 
16. READ, and the member named with its suffix: data more
17. MID$ and SWAP: more d#ta
18. compared
19. a local array, twice: []y 2 []y 3 
